OL,3,GNEWSAWitness appeal after man found
OL,4,Astabbed in street
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man was left needing hospital
OL,7,Ftreatment after being stabbed in the
OL,8,Fstreet in Leeds, police have said.
OL,10,FThe 27-year-old man was found with stab
OL,11,Finjuries on Harehills Road at about
OL,12,F13:50 BST on Sunday, according to West
OL,13,FYorkshire Police.
OL,15,FInquiries established that the man -
OL,16,Fwhose injuries were not believed to be
OL,17,Flife-threatening - had been assaulted
OL,18,Fnear the junction with Bexley Terrace,
OL,19,Fa force spokesperson said.
